{"parse": {"title": "LPdF-07", "pageid": 114322, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LPdF-06\" title=\"LPdF-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LPdF-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/LPdF-08\" title=\"LPdF-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LPdF</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.A5.9E.E7.BE.94.E7.BE.8A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"神羔羊\">神羔羊</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 神羔羊</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Agnus Dei</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>名<span class=\"color-value\"></span>合<span class=\"color-value\"></span>格<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>绘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>画<span class=\"color-value\"></span>模<span class=\"color-value\"></span>特<span class=\"color-value\"></span>要<span class=\"color-value\"></span>像<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>块<span class=\"color-value\"></span>坚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>冰<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>样<span class=\"color-value\"></span>冷<span class=\"color-value\"></span>酷<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>滑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>溜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>溜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>且<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>动<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>衷<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 30510107</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"text-align:left\">          他们说——</span><br /><br /><span style=\"text-align:left\">          来吧！我们来建一座城，城里要有塔，高达云霄。</span><br /></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_05.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_05\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_05\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-s01_bg_05.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_05.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-s01_bg_05.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_05.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-s01_bg_05.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_05.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>这些壁画褪色得很厉害。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>嗯……上面画的既不是圣经故事，和古希腊神话似乎也没什么关系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>或许是某种奇妙的隐喻？只要读懂它，就能找到密室的开关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>但问题是……我们该按照什么顺序来观赏这些画呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>湿壁画的观赏顺序没有固定讲究。大多是从入口开始，按照从上到下的顺序来理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>按照这个顺序来看，似乎讲述的是一群人和一只神奇小鸟的故事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾吉奥：</div><div>除开中间这部分，是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他望向壁画中央的空白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在它周围，褪色的群青与赭石仿佛心照不宣一般，纷纷绕开这一区域，谁也不曾越界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自此，所有疑问似乎都将在这一方白色墙面上找到栖息之地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">APPLe：</div><div>究竟是怎么回事呢……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_13\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-s01_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-s01_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-s01_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>究竟是怎么回事呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-635011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-635011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-635011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>苏芙比的脸——！！呜……怎么会变成这样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-635101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-635101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-635101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>别害怕，这只是草稿阶段。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-635101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-635101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-635101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>我画这些结构，是因为我不想让你看起来像一个无趣的躯壳！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-635101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-635101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-635101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>因此我需要通过它们来理解你如何站立，如何动作，如何表达情感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-635011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-635011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-635011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>真的吗？所以苏芙比还是可以拥有一幅完美的肖像？五彩缤纷的，有许多天使环绕的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-635101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-635101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/HeadIconSmall-635101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>准确来说，不是你的肖像，是圣母的肖像。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-635111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-635111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-635111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>不过你所期待的东西都会有，这便是这张草图的意义！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"635010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-635010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-635010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"635010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-635010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-635010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-635010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-635010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>好耶！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我以为我们只是做做样子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>那怎么行，阿尔贝托神父随时会过来检查的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我明白了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我注意到你在背景里用了许多辅助线，似乎用到了透视理论？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>画家的双眼忽然亮了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>想不到你也知道这个！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>在我们的家乡，许多画家似乎都知道这个理论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>你们的家乡是什么绘画天堂吗？难道那里连路边的石头都在用画笔讲故事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>噢！如果真是那样的话，想想就很有趣呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>苏芙比没有画过石头，但是画过很多鸡蛋。卡森先生说是因为您小时候——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>咳咳，打断一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>莱昂纳多先生，能讲讲这里的透视技巧吗？或许我们对于透视有着不同的理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">莱昂纳多：</div><div>没问题！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LPdF-07"}}